# Audio is ignored (2 GB); the EVIDENCE is not.
#
# An earlier version ignored out/ wholesale, which meant a clean checkout held
# none of the numbers REPORT.md calls reproducible. The JSON artifacts are ~52 KB
# in total and are the actual evidence, so they are committed; the audio they
# were derived from is regenerable with the checked-in scripts:
#
#   eval/fetch_audio.py       re-fetches the inputs via riffd's own downloader
#   eval/run_incumbent.py     re-runs the Replicate baseline
#   eval/run_cascade.py       re-runs the deployed Modal cascade
#   eval/run_long_track.py    re-runs the 20-minute track
audio/
out/**/*.flac
out/**/*.wav
out/**/*.mp3
